{"meta":{"ph":"sɪŋk; NAmE sɪŋk","pos":"verb","stars":"★★"},"defs":[{"def":"to go down below the surface or towards the bottom of a liquid or soft substance 下沉；下陷；沉没","ex":[{"s":"Progress can be slow, and you’ll wonder if it’s all sinking in.","src":"2026新高考II卷·七选五","cat":"gaokao","year":2026,"t":"进展可能缓慢，你会怀疑是否都吸收进去了。"},{"s":"Now, I ____60____ (suppose) to feel the weight on my legs and sink my dan tian.","src":"2026新高考II卷·语法填空","cat":"gaokao","year":2026,"t":"现在____60____,我要感觉到腿上的重量 并沉下我的丹蒂安。"},{"s":"But one day when I heard her saying “I think I’m too fat,” my heart sank.","src":"2025浙江1月卷·阅读理解B","cat":"gaokao","year":2025,"t":"但有一天我听到她说“我觉得我太胖了”,我的心就沉了。"},{"s":"Despite her encouraging smile, I wanted to sink through the floor because I was unsure about its pronunciation as well as its meaning.","src":"2024天津3月卷·阅读Passage 3","cat":"gaokao","year":2024,"t":"尽管她鼓励地微笑着，我却恨不得钻到地板底下去，因为我对它的发音和意思都不确定。"},{"s":"Writing was so difficult and painful for me that my teacher had allowed me to present my paper on the sinking of the Titanic by acting out a play, where I played all the parts.","src":"2023新课标I卷·书面表达","cat":"gaokao","year":2023,"t":"写作对我来说太困难、太痛苦，以至于老师允许我通过表演一出戏来呈现关于泰坦尼克号沉没的论文，在戏里我扮演了所有角色。"},{"s":"Writing was so difficult and painful for me that my teacher had allowed me to present my paper on the sinking of the Titanic by acting out a play, where I played all the parts.","src":"2023新课标II卷·书面表达","cat":"gaokao","year":2023,"t":"写作对我来说太困难、太痛苦，以至于老师允许我通过表演一出戏来呈现关于泰坦尼克号沉没的论文，在戏里我扮演了所有角色。"},{"s":"Jenna threw the burnt piece into the sink and put in the other slice of bread.","src":"2021卷","cat":"gaokao","year":2021,"t":"詹娜把烤焦的那片扔进   水池，又放进去另一片面包。"},{"s":"Jenna threw the burnt piece into the  sink and put in the other slice of bread.","src":"2021新高考II卷·A MOTHER’S DAY SURPRISE","cat":"gaokao","year":2021,"t":"詹娜把烤焦的那片扔进   水池，又放进去另一片面包。"}]},{"def":"to damage a boat or ship so that it goes below the surface of the sea, etc. 使下沉；使沉没","ex":[]},{"def":"to move downwards, especially by falling or sitting down 人","ex":[]},{"def":"to move slowly downwards 物体","ex":[]},{"def":"to decrease in amount, volume, strength, etc. 降低；减少；减弱","ex":[{"s":"“Even in families whose parents didn't have a college education... families are smaller, and the idea that children need to be carefully ___53___ has really sunk in.” The ___54___ of “adult activities” could not be attributed to more homework or extracurricular activities, the study said, noting that teens today spend fewer hours on homework and the same amount of time on extracurricular as they did in the 1990s ( with the exception of community service, which has risen slightly).","src":"2018上海卷·Section A","cat":"gaokao","year":2018,"t":"“即使在父母没有受过大学教育的家庭里,家庭规模也较小,儿童需要谨慎的想法____53____确实已经沉没了____54____。” “成人活动”不能归因于更多的家庭作业或课外活动,该研究指出,青少年今天在家庭作业上花费的时间较少,在课外时间也与1990年代相同(社区服务除外,它略有上升)。"}]},{"def":"to become quieter 变低；变小","ex":[]},{"def":"to make a deep hole in the ground 挖，掘（深坑、深洞）","ex":[]},{"def":"to place sth in the ground by digging 埋入；打下","ex":[]},{"def":"to prevent sb or sb's plans from succeeding 使失败；使受挫；阻挠","ex":[]},{"def":"to hit a ball into a hole in golf or snooker （高尔夫球）击球入洞；（斯诺克）击球入袋","ex":[]},{"def":"to drink sth quickly, especially a large amount of alcohol 猛喝；灌","ex":[]},{"def":"to be fully understood or realized 话语、事情等","ex":[{"s":"With a sinking feeling, he realized that he actually     43       doing it.","src":"2017江苏卷·完形填空","cat":"gaokao","year":2017,"t":"带着一种失落感，他意识到自己其实____做这件事。"}]},{"def":"to go down into another substance through the surface 液体","ex":[{"s":"Ben Dear Ben, There is an old American saying, “Loose lips sink ships.” This means that if you speak too much about something, especially to people who you don’t know so well, it’ll cause all kinds of trouble.","src":"外研社B3 U1","cat":"waiyan","t":"本·亲爱的本(Ben Dear Ben ) , 有一句古老的美国谚语 : “ 唇沉船 ” 。 这意味着如果你对某件事说得太多,特别是对那些你不了解的人来说,那会引发各种麻烦。"},{"s":"The response from a publisher comes back and the writer eagerly opens and reads it, their hearts sinking when they reach that final sentence.","src":"外研社B4 U2","cat":"waiyan","t":"出版商的反应又来了,编剧急切地打开并阅读了它,他们到达最后一句后心就沉没了."},{"s":"It was from this cold, wet and uncomfortable camp that they watched the Endurance sink into the icy sea.","src":"外研社B4 U6","cat":"waiyan","t":"正是从这个寒冷,湿润和不舒服的营地,他们看着耐力号沉入冰海."},{"s":"In the past few weeks, an increasing sense of 3 depressed / variantwaveshadnearlydestroyedtheship.Theythoughttheywould5sink/capturebut thankfully, the 6 solid / sawed wooden frame and sails had held together.","src":"北师大选必3 U9","cat":"beishida","t":"在过去的几周里,一种越来越强烈的3种压抑/变形波影几乎摧毁了飞船。 他们认为他们将会沉没/捕获,但幸好,这6种固态/锯木框和帆合在一起。"}]},{"def":"a large open container in a kitchen that has taps/faucets to supply water and that you use for washing dishes in （厨房里的）洗涤池，洗碗槽","ex":[]}]}